Insider dealing and inside information (LEGAL-MNPI)

Issuer: Moser Slovakia s. r. o. · IČO 47 556 210 · Twin City C, Mlynské nivy 12, 821 09 Bratislava

Effective: 1 January 2026  
Owner: Legal and Compliance, Moser Slovakia s. r. o.

Inside information, also called material non-public information or MNPI, includes unreleased earnings, the sales pipeline and any live M&A discussion. Employees must not trade on unreleased earnings and must not pass MNPI to family, advisers or social media.

Insider dealing is prohibited by the Market Abuse Regulation (EU) 596/2014, which applies directly in Slovakia and is supervised by Národná banka Slovenska. Tipping a friend is prohibited on the same basis. During a closed period you must not trade the group's securities at all.

Anyone with access to a project code name is entered on the insider list kept by Legal. Legal does not give "hypothetical" trading opinions on MNPI — escalate to Compliance instead.

